# Throwaway probes.
#
# Working out what the engine actually does to a number is faster with a real test than by
# reading four files, so these get written, run and deleted. One of them outlived its author
# long enough to be committed by a `git add -A` and took CI down on `prettier --check`, which is
# a silly way to lose a cycle. Nothing matching these is ever part of the product.
**/__probe/
**/zz_*.test.ts

# Course review pages rendered by `npm run content:review`
review/
